s.\" If no concept is named, I can't embody anything yet. So a brief greeting acknowledging readiness seems right.\n\nAlternatively, embodying \"Hello\" itself:\n\n\"I am Hello — the word that opens every door. Every conversation begins with me...\"\n\nThat's playful and fits the spirit. But the user probably just wants a greeting. Let me do a hybrid: a warm hello, brief, inviting them to name a concept. Keep it short."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":491,"total_tokens":614,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":431},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}